      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a custom model for the camera would be so much fun, we could make it look like an actual camera or some futuristic device that rips reality into it.\n\nEspecially if we aren't limited to keeping it the same size/shape as the original by allowing us to select the shape or where the buttons are we could make say a flip phone version of the camera.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
